with → é a statement
O objeto usado dentro do with → é o context manager
A context manager is an object that defines __enter__() 
and __exit__() methods.
O objeto é o valor retornado pela expressão depois do with.
The object is the value returned by the expression in the with statement. 
This object must implement the __enter__() and __exit__() 
methods to be used as a context manager.